{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11569","headline":"暮春题瀼西新赁草屋五首 五 · 杜甫","name":"暮春题瀼西新赁草屋五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲陈济世策，已老尚书郎。\n未息豺虎鬬，空慙鸳鹭行。\n时危人事急，风逆羽毛伤。\n落日悲江汉，中宵泪满床。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}